// `tab part with chords CHORDPART [as …]` attaches a chord part's symbols above
// a TAB staff, exactly like the notation-staff `staff … with chords …` form.
// Here the guitar tab carries the fingering while the harmony row prints C / F
// above it.
octave absolute
time 4/4
key c major
part melody { clef treble_8 tuning guitar section A { c'4 e' g' e' | f' a' c'' a' | } }
chords harmony { section A { c1 | f1 | } }
form main { A }
score main {
  tab melody with chords harmony
}
